Hello,

To access your DNS, you have to

   1 - have a /etc/resolv.conf file
         ex:
            domain      anywhere.edu
            nameserver  server.anywhere.edu

   2 - do the following changes in your /etc/svc.conf
         
            replace 
               host=local
            by
               host=bind,local


