Our problem turned out to be the order of the include files inside files
that have functions that perform I/O.  It appears it is necessary to have
the '#include <pthread.h>' statement as the first included file.  This
information is buried in section 9.4.1 of DEC's OSF/1 Programmers Guide,
in the section on multi threaded applications.
